---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
const controls = [
  ['W A S D / arrow keys', 'Move relative to the camera'],
  ['Space', 'Jump'],
  ['Shift (hold)', 'Sprint'],
  ['Mouse', 'Aim and rotate the camera'],
  ['Left click (hold)', 'Attract objects and knocked-down rivals'],
  ['Right click', 'Repulse: launch held objects and push rivals back'],
  ['Esc', 'Pause or resume'],
];
---
<SiteLayout title="Player Support | Magnet Mayhem" description="Get help with Magnet Mayhem controls, training, stage progression, saved progress, and troubleshooting. Contact Withcenter for support.">
  <section class="page-intro section-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">LET’S GET YOU BACK IN THE ARENA</p><h1>A little help.<br />A lot more mayhem<span class="red-period">.</span></h1><p>Controls, quick answers, and a real way to reach us.</p><nav class="anchor-nav" aria-label="Support topics"><a href="#controls">Controls</a><a href="#training">Training</a><a href="#progress">Progress</a><a href="#troubleshooting">Troubleshooting</a></nav></section>
  <div class="content-wrap">
    <section class="contact-panel" aria-labelledby="contact-title"><h2 id="contact-title">Something not quite right?</h2><p>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and tell us what happened. Include your device and operating system, game version, and the steps that led to the problem. A screenshot can help explain what you’re seeing.</p></section>
    <section id="controls" aria-labelledby="controls-title"><h2 id="controls-title">One magnet. Two big moves.</h2><p><strong>ATTRACT</strong> pulls magnetic objects and knocked-down rivals toward you. <strong>REPULSE</strong> launches what you’re holding and pushes nearby opponents back. Knock every rival off the floating arena to win. If you fall, the round is over.</p><h3>On a phone or tablet</h3><ul><li>Move with the floating joystick on the left. Push it to the edge to sprint.</li><li>Drag elsewhere on the screen to aim and rotate the camera.</li><li>Hold <strong>ATTRACT</strong> to pull objects in; release it to throw.</li><li>Use <strong>REPULSE</strong> to blast targets away and <strong>JUMP</strong> to jump.</li><li>Tap the pause button under the match timer to pause.</li></ul><h3>With a keyboard and mouse</h3><p>Click the game window to capture the mouse. Choose the right-handed or left-handed preset in Settings; movement, jump, and sprint keys can be rebound.</p><table><caption class="sr-only">Default keyboard and mouse controls</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Input</th><th scope="col">Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>{controls.map(([input, action]) => <tr><td><strong>{input}</strong></td><td>{action}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table><h3>Camera moving too quickly?</h3><p>Open Settings in touch mode and adjust <strong>Camera sensitivity</strong>. The separate <strong>While attracting</strong> setting lets you fine-tune aiming while holding ATTRACT.</p></section>
    <section id="training" aria-labelledby="training-title"><h2 id="training-title">New here? Start with training.</h2><p>Choose <strong>HOW TO PLAY</strong> from the main menu to enter guided training. It teaches movement, aiming, magnet moves, and ring outs step by step. Falling in training respawns you, so experiment freely.</p><p>During a match, pause and choose <strong>HOW TO PLAY</strong> for a quick reference. Starting training from there asks before leaving your match.</p></section>
    <section id="progress" aria-labelledby="progress-title"><h2 id="progress-title">Stages and saved progress.</h2><p>Stage 1 is available at the start. Win a stage to unlock the next one. There are nine campaign stages, each with more opponents and a more challenging arena.</p><p>Progress and settings are saved on your device. The game has no account or cloud-save system. Uninstalling the game or clearing its app data can remove that local save; we cannot recover device-local progress through an account.</p></section>
    <section id="troubleshooting" aria-labelledby="troubleshooting-title"><h2 id="troubleshooting-title">Quick troubleshooting.</h2><h3>My magnet won’t attract a rival.</h3><p>Only knocked-down rivals can be attracted. Hit one with a launched object first. ATTRACT also needs magnet power; let the meter refill if it has run out.</p><h3>REPULSE isn’t ready.</h3><p>Repulse has a cooldown. Check the indicator at the bottom right and wait for it to show READY.</p><h3>The game is stuck or won’t start.</h3><p>Close and reopen the game. Check your store for an update. If the problem continues, email us with your device, game version, and what you see. Avoid uninstalling or clearing app data if you want to keep your saved progress.</p><h3>Do I need an internet connection?</h3><p>The installed game works fully offline. It has no sign-in, ads, or in-app purchases. Downloading or updating through an app store still requires a connection.</p></section>
    <p><a href="/">Back to the game ↗</a></p>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
